description:
Records that the reader read a poem from the ReadingRate collection, adding one read to its count. Poems the reader returns to often rank higher in get_poetry_reading_stats, and recent reads can feature in their daily reading connections. A work in sections, such as an epic, is logged one section at a time.

Use when the reader says they read or reread a poem, or asks to mark one as read. Each call adds one more read.

Examples:
- {"identifier": "wyatt/whoso-list-to-hunt"}
- {"identifier": "milton/paradise-lost", "section": 1}
